{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 实验 6：动态网页爬取\n",
    "\n",
    "根据实验报告选择要求 1、2：百度自动检索、模拟鼠标翻页爬取软科 2025 中国大学排名并保存 CSV 和网页截图。\n",
    "\n",
    "请选择本机 bigdata Python 环境，重启内核后从上到下运行。第一格安装依赖；如安装后无法导入，请重启内核。输出保存在当前工作目录。网站出现验证码时，请在浏览器中检查后重新运行相应任务。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "18750721",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%pip install \"selenium>=4.6,<5\" pandas"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 导入所需库"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import time\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from selenium import webdriver\n",
    "from selenium.common.exceptions import StaleElementReferenceException, TimeoutException\n",
    "from selenium.webdriver.edge.service import Service\n",
    "from selenium.webdriver.common.by import By\n",
    "from selenium.webdriver.common.keys import Keys\n",
    "from selenium.webdriver.common.action_chains import ActionChains\n",
    "from selenium.webdriver.support.ui import WebDriverWait\n",
    "from selenium.webdriver.support import expected_conditions as EC\n",
    "KEYWORD = \"大数据采集与处理\"\n",
    "HEADLESS = False  # 自动验证可设 True；截图时使用 False\n",
    "OUTPUT_DIR = Path.cwd()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 启动 Edge 浏览器\n",
    "\n",
    "优先使用本地驱动，路径不存在时由 Selenium Manager 自动管理（首次需要联网）。驱动版本应与 Edge 匹配。固定窗口尺寸，避免重复最大化报错。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "EDGE_DRIVER_PATH = Path(r\"D:/msedgedriver64/msedgedriver.exe\")\n",
    "if \"driver\" in globals():\n",
    "    driver.quit()\n",
    "options = webdriver.EdgeOptions()\n",
    "options.add_argument(\"--window-size=1440,1000\")\n",
    "if HEADLESS:\n",
    "    options.add_argument(\"--headless=new\")\n",
    "if EDGE_DRIVER_PATH.is_file():\n",
    "    driver = webdriver.Edge(service=Service(str(EDGE_DRIVER_PATH)), options=options)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    driver = webdriver.Edge(options=options)\n",
    "driver.set_page_load_timeout(60)\n",
    "wait = WebDriverWait(driver, 30)\n",
    "print(\"Edge 启动成功：\", driver.capabilities.get(\"browserVersion\"))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 任务一：使用 Selenium 自动搜索百度\n",
    "\n",
    "打开百度首页，输入关键词，点击搜索，并输出部分搜索结果标题。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "driver.get(\"https://www.baidu.com\")\n",
    "\n",
    "def visible_search_box(browser):\n",
    "    for element in browser.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, \"#kw, #chat-textarea, input[name='wd']\"):\n",
    "        if element.is_displayed() and element.is_enabled():\n",
    "            return element\n",
    "    return False\n",
    "\n",
    "def baidu_needs_verification(browser):\n",
    "    return (\"wappass.baidu.com\" in browser.current_url\n",
    "            or \"百度安全验证\" in browser.title)\n",
    "\n",
    "def collect_baidu_results(timeout=30):\n",
    "    \"\"\"人工验证完成后，可单独执行 collect_baidu_results()，无需重新搜索。\"\"\"\n",
    "    result_titles = WebDriverWait(driver, timeout).until(lambda browser: [\n",
    "        e.text.strip()\n",
    "        for e in browser.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, \"#content_left h3\")\n",
    "        if e.is_displayed() and e.text.strip()\n",
    "    ])\n",
    "    print(\"关键词：\", KEYWORD)\n",
    "    for i, title in enumerate(result_titles[:10], 1):\n",
    "        print(f\"{i}. {title}\")\n",
    "    driver.save_screenshot(str(OUTPUT_DIR / \"百度检索结果.png\"))\n",
    "    return result_titles\n",
    "\n",
    "titles = []\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    search_box = wait.until(visible_search_box)\n",
    "    search_box.clear()\n",
    "    search_box.send_keys(KEYWORD)\n",
    "    submit_buttons = driver.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, \"#su, #chat-submit-button\")\n",
    "    submit_button = next((e for e in submit_buttons if e.is_displayed() and e.is_enabled()), None)\n",
    "    if submit_button is not None:\n",
    "        submit_button.click()\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        search_box.send_keys(Keys.ENTER)\n",
    "    wait.until(lambda browser: baidu_needs_verification(browser)\n",
    "               or any(e.is_displayed() for e in browser.find_elements(By.ID, \"content_left\")))\n",
    "    if baidu_needs_verification(driver):\n",
    "        print(\"百度要求安全验证，请在 Edge 中手动完成。\")\n",
    "        if not HEADLESS:\n",
    "            print(\"等待人工验证，最多 120 秒……\")\n",
    "            titles = collect_baidu_results(timeout=120)\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            print(\"当前是无界面模式；请将 HEADLESS 设为 False 后重新启动浏览器并运行本任务。\")\n",
    "            driver.save_screenshot(str(OUTPUT_DIR / \"百度安全验证.png\"))\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        titles = collect_baidu_results()\n",
    "except TimeoutException:\n",
    "    print(\"等待百度结果超时，本次未获取到检索结果。\")\n",
    "    print(\"当前网址：\", driver.current_url)\n",
    "    print(\"页面标题：\", driver.title)\n",
    "    if baidu_needs_verification(driver):\n",
    "        print(\"请手动完成安全验证后，在新单元格运行：titles = collect_baidu_results()\")\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        print(\"请检查浏览器中的网络或页面状态；若已显示结果，运行：titles = collect_baidu_results()\")\n",
    "    driver.save_screenshot(str(OUTPUT_DIR / \"百度等待超时.png\"))\n",
    "    print(\"可以继续运行后面的软科采集单元格。\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 任务二：爬取软科 2025 年中国大学排名\n",
    "\n",
    "进入软科排名页面，提取每页的排名、学校名称、标签、省市和类型，再通过点击“下一页”继续爬取。\n",
    "\n",
    "页面地址：https://www.shanghairanking.cn/rankings/bcur/2025"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "rank_url = \"https://www.shanghairanking.cn/rankings/bcur/2025\"\n",
    "ROW_SELECTOR = \"#content-box table tbody tr\"\n",
    "NEXT_SELECTOR = \"#content-box li.ant-pagination-next\"\n",
    "def get_text(parent, selector):\n",
    "    elements = parent.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, selector)\n",
    "    return elements[0].text.strip() if elements else \"\"\n",
    "def parse_page():\n",
    "    data = []\n",
    "    for row in driver.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, ROW_SELECTOR):\n",
    "        cells = row.find_elements(By.TAG_NAME, \"td\")\n",
    "        if len(cells) < 4:\n",
    "            continue\n",
    "        school = get_text(cells[1], \".name-cn\")\n",
    "        rank = cells[0].text.strip()\n",
    "        if school and rank:\n",
    "            data.append({\"排名\": rank, \"学校名称\": school, \"标签\": get_text(cells[1], \".tags\"), \"省市\": cells[2].text.strip(), \"类型\": cells[3].text.strip()})\n",
    "    return data\n",
    "def page_ready(browser):\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        return parse_page() or False\n",
    "    except StaleElementReferenceException:\n",
    "        return False"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 模拟鼠标翻页采集数据\n",
    "\n",
    "每次运行从第一页开始，最多 20 页，末页提前结束。可将 MAX_PAGES 改为 2 快速验证。以首行数据变化判断翻页完成，适应页面复用 DOM 的情况。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "MAX_PAGES = 20\n",
    "if not isinstance(MAX_PAGES, int) or MAX_PAGES < 1:\n",
    "    raise ValueError(\"MAX_PAGES 必须是正整数\")\n",
    "all_data = []\n",
    "started = time.perf_counter()\n",
    "driver.get(rank_url)\n",
    "for page in range(1, MAX_PAGES + 1):\n",
    "    page_data = wait.until(page_ready)\n",
    "    all_data.extend(page_data)\n",
    "    print(f\"第 {page} 页：采集 {len(page_data)} 条\")\n",
    "    if page == MAX_PAGES:\n",
    "        break\n",
    "    next_li = wait.until(EC.presence_of_element_located((By.CSS_SELECTOR, NEXT_SELECTOR)))\n",
    "    if \"ant-pagination-disabled\" in (next_li.get_attribute(\"class\") or \"\"):\n",
    "        break\n",
    "    previous_first = (page_data[0][\"排名\"], page_data[0][\"学校名称\"])\n",
    "    driver.execute_script(\"arguments[0].scrollIntoView({block: 'center'});\", next_li)\n",
    "    ActionChains(driver).move_to_element(next_li).click().perform()\n",
    "    def page_changed(browser):\n",
    "        data = page_ready(browser)\n",
    "        return data if data and (data[0][\"排名\"], data[0][\"学校名称\"]) != previous_first else False\n",
    "    wait.until(page_changed)\n",
    "    time.sleep(0.5)\n",
    "print(f\"总采集条数：{len(all_data)}，耗时：{time.perf_counter() - started:.1f} 秒\")\n",
    "driver.save_screenshot(str(OUTPUT_DIR / \"软科排名页面.png\"))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. 保存数据"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "if not all_data:\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError(\"请先成功运行第 5 节采集数据\")\n",
    "df = pd.DataFrame(all_data).drop_duplicates(subset=[\"学校名称\"]).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "output_path = OUTPUT_DIR / \"软科2025中国大学排名.csv\"\n",
    "df.to_csv(output_path, index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")\n",
    "print(df.head(10).to_string(index=False))\n",
    "print(\"去重后数据条数：\", len(df))\n",
    "print(\"保存位置：\", output_path.resolve())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. 实验知识点\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 根据 id 定位元素：`driver.find_element(By.ID, \"元素id\")`。\n",
    "2. 根据 CSS 选择器定位元素：`driver.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, \"选择器\")`。\n",
    "3. 显式等待：`WebDriverWait(driver, 10).until(...)`。\n",
    "4. 固定等待：`time.sleep(1)`。\n",
    "5. 模拟鼠标点击：`ActionChains(driver).move_to_element(element).click().perform()`。\n",
    "6. 获取标签文本：`element.text`。\n",
    "7. 保存数据：`DataFrame.to_csv()`。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. 关闭浏览器"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "driver.quit()\n",
    "print(\"浏览器已关闭\")"
   ]
  }
 ],
